\end{equation}$$ Thus $W_\alpha^{\mathrm a}$ solves the equation (7.1) with the period $S(\alpha)$ and with the force $-\sum_i\beta_i^{\mathrm a}(\alpha)\,b_i$, up to the residual and up to a gradient.

